# Cloud Build 에 올릴 파일만 (없으면 .gitignore 를 따라 data/ 가 통째로 빠져 빌드가 실패함)
/*
!/src/
!/rules/
!/server/
!/deploy/
!/data/
/data/*
!/data/processed/
/data/processed/*
!/data/processed/items_japan.json
!/data/interim/
/data/interim/*
!/data/interim/osm_stations_jp.json
!/data/geoip/
**/__pycache__/
/server/tools/
*.db
*.db-*
/deploy/prod.env
